WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.333
Road grading holds the asphalt. Drainage and surfacing are waiting.

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:05.792
“Keep the curb at eighteen centimeters and move the grate to eighty three centimeters.”

00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:06.250
Road grading holds the asphalt. Drainage and surfacing are waiting.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:06.625
Drainage holds the 83 cm grant. The grate is still at 50 cm.

00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:12.333
“Keep the curb at eighteen centimeters and move the grate to seventy two centimeters.”

00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:13.083
Drainage holds the 83 cm grant. The grate is still at 50 cm.

00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:14.625
Drainage yielded. Surfacing finished the patina before the 72 cm grant.

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:16.042
Drainage moved the grate to 72 cm. The curb stayed at 18 cm.

00:00:16.042 --> 00:00:17.542
Surfacing committed the road coat after the move.

00:00:17.542 --> 00:00:18.417
All three approved undo. The grate returned to 50 cm with its finish preserved.

